---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Charles Michael Sports Hub handles information when you visit this website or contact the hub."
>
  <section class="bg-navy text-white py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="section-subtitle text-red-brand">Your Information</p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-6xl md:text-8xl leading-none mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-blue-100 text-xl max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        This draft explains the information this website may involve. CMSH must confirm its actual practices and publish verified contact details before launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-9">
      <div class="bg-bluegrey border-l-4 border-red-brand p-6 rounded-r-xl">
        <p class="font-body text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Draft notice:</strong> This template is not legal advice. Confirm the data controller, purposes, retention periods, processors, and data-subject contact process with a qualified adviser before publishing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Who is responsible?</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Charles Michael Sports Hub (CMSH), based in Limuru, Kiambu County, Kenya, is responsible for information it collects through its activities, subject to confirmation of the correct legal entity and contact details. A verified privacy contact will be published when available.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Information and website use</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          The registration form runs in your browser and prepares a message using the details you enter. It does not submit those details to or store them on this website. If you choose to open WhatsApp and send the message, the information will be shared with WhatsApp and Charles Michael Sports Hub. WhatsApp is operated by Meta and its own privacy terms apply.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Website hosting may process technical request information, such as an IP address, browser details, and requested page, to deliver and protect the site. The site loads fonts from Google Fonts, which may receive connection information when a font is requested. Verify current hosting, font, analytics, and other third-party services before launch; this notice must be updated if that setup changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">How information may be used</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          If you send a registration enquiry, CMSH may use the details you share to respond, discuss the sports you selected, and explain programme availability or next steps. A registration enquiry does not itself confirm admission to a programme. A parent or guardian should provide details for anyone under 18.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Sharing, retention, and your choices</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          The website does not store the registration form details. If you send them through WhatsApp, they are handled by WhatsApp and received by CMSH. Do not include medical or other sensitive information in the form. To ask about access, correction, deletion or other applicable privacy rights, contact CMSH at <a href="mailto:info@charlesmsports.com" class="text-navy underline">info@charlesmsports.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl text-navy mb-3">Changes to this notice</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We will update this page if the website's data practices change. The effective date and a process for notifying affected people should be added when the policy is approved.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
